    "lyrics": "# **Ghost in The Machine CHH**\n\n# **Ghost In The Machine \\- CHH**\n\n\\[Vocal Archetype: Kane\\]  \n\\[Specific Delivery: Tectonic Powerhouse. Deep, resonant chest voice. Behind-the-beat pocket. Verses: Gruff, conversational flow. Chorus: Aggressive, staccato punch.\\]\n\n\\[Intro\\]  \n\\[Industrial 808 distortion; Low-frequency hum; Metallic percussion claps\\]  \n(Kane \\- Deep, distorted growl)  \nBrick OS. System override.   \nKingdom logic in a binary world.\n\n\\[Verse 1\\]  \n\\[Syncopated Trap Flow; Heavy focus on off-beats\\]  \nThey got the data on your dopamine, they\u2019re mining for your soul  \nA digital panopticon that\u2019s fighting for control  \nIt\u2019s the validation-vacation, a synthetic location  \nBuilding your foundation on a pixelated nation? (Nah)  \nI see the ghost in the wires, the liar in the code  \nSelling you a shortcut on a heavy-burden road  \nYou're counting \"likes\" while you're losing the Likeness  \nStaring at the brightness, blinded by the psychosis.\n\n\\[Pre-Chorus\\]  \n\\[Rising Sub-bass; Aggressive enunciation\\]  \nIt\u2019s not a glitch, it\u2019s a design to keep your spirit low  \nI\u2019m cutting through the signal, man, I\u2019m letting it all go  \nI\u2019m pulling out the hardware, I\u2019m crashing through the wall  \nThe system\u2019s gonna crumble but the Word is gonna stand tall\\!\n\n\\[Chorus\\]  \n\\[Volcano Drop \\- 60-Second Standalone Viral Hook\\]  \n\\[Specific Energy Meta-Tag: Heavy Industrial CHH\\]  \nHe\u2019s not a GHOST in the machine\\!  \nHe\u2019s the KING of everything I\u2019ve seen\\!  \n(Hard Stop \\- Bass Drop)  \nHe\u2019s NOT a ghost in the machine\\!  \nHe\u2019s the KING of everything I\u2019ve seen\\!\n\n\\[Verse 2\\]  \n\\[Technical Flow \\- Multisyllabic focus\\]  \nI beat the system with the Wisdom, my vision is corrected  \nThe enemy is frantic 'cause my spirit is protected  \nDomestic earnestness\u2014I'm focused on my family tree  \nWhile you\u2019re scrolling through the feed of a dead philosophy  \nMy DNA was scripted by the Weaver, not the web  \nI\u2019m riding on the Spirit while the digital is at an ebb  \nFinancial independence, yeah, I\u2019m owning every master  \nFollowing the Shepherd, not the algorithm's pastor\\!\n\n\\[Bridge\\]  \n\\[The Throne Room Pivot \\- Total silence then Low-Fi Rhodes\\]  \n(Intimate, raw vocal \\- Zero pitch correction)  \nI\u2019m lifting my eyes from the glow of the dust  \nTrading the \"clicks\" for the One that I trust  \nThere\u2019s a Frequency louder than the static in the air...  \n(MASSIVE 808 EXPLOSION \\- \"HOLY\\!\")  \nThe Lion's in the room, tell the matrix to beware\\!\n\n\\[Final Chorus\\]  \n\\[Maximum Density \\- Aggressive Brass Stabs\\]  \nHe\u2019s not a GHOST in the machine\\!  \nHe\u2019s the KING of everything I\u2019ve seen\\!  \nThe shadow isn't hiding, yeah, I see the whole design  \nThe Spirit is the frequency, the victory is mine\\!\n\n\\[Outro\\]  \n\\[Vinyl scratch and power down\\]  \n(Kane \\- Spoken, authoritative)  \nUnplugged. Fully connected.  \nKingdom online.  \n\\[End\\]",
